Third-party material in this repository
=======================================

src/obp_lite/
  Re-implements part of the Open Bandit Pipeline (https://github.com/st-tech/zr-obp),
  Copyright ZOZO Technologies / ZOZO Research, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  The licence text is in src/obp_lite/LICENSE-APACHE-2.0. Changes: rewritten to run
  on current numpy, pandas and scikit-learn without PyTorch; same estimator formulas.

data/obd/
  The 10,000-row sample of the Open Bandit Dataset (ZOZO, Inc.), copied from the
  zr-obp repository, together with the production Beta prior (prior_bts.yaml).
  The full dataset is available from https://research.zozo.com/data.html.
  When using the dataset, cite:
    Saito, Aihara, Matsutani and Narita. "Open Bandit Dataset and Pipeline: Towards
    Realistic and Reproducible Off-Policy Evaluation." NeurIPS 2021 Datasets and
    Benchmarks Track. arXiv:2008.07146.
